                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of several devices for opening letters, either by breaking wax seals or (as is usually the case today) by cutting open their envelopes.",
                                            "The same sort of device but with a sharpened edge, designed to appeal to customers who enjoy a sharpened one (regardless of whether or not it truly outperforms the nonsharp counterpart)."
